            "reset": "<p>The hazard deactivates 1 minute after all living creatures leave the area or after all three heads are destroyed. After 1 hour, if at least one head remains, the hazard reactivates.</p>",
            "routine": "<p>(3 actions) For each mukradi skull disabled or destroyed, the haunt has 1 fewer action. On each action, a different head moves up to 30 feet and attempts a maw Strike against a different living creature.</p>"
